[{"id":1782892713646,"text":"","rawContent":"","isHtml":false,"sticker":"https://i.postimg.cc/VkRbjdjd/IMG_5403.gif","stickerMeaning":"可以吗？","sender":"them","time":"17:11","timestamp":1782897113979,"roundId":"round_1782897035651_1rami8rjj","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":159},{"id":1782892713647,"text":"哈哈精灵不都是高傲的生物吗","sender":"me","time":"17:12","timestamp":1782897135541,"replyTo":{"id":1782892713642,"text":"如果是亲爱的想做善事，我、我肯定支持。可是……万一他们被放生之后，非要说无以为报，赖着留下来给您当奴隶怎么办？","sender":"them","sticker":null,"isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":160},{"id":1782892713648,"text":"不会的吧！","sender":"me","time":"17:12","timestamp":1782897138012,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":161},{"id":1782892713649,"text":"我们只是普通做好事","sender":"me","time":"17:12","timestamp":1782897143247,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":162},{"id":1782892713650,"text":"抱抱猫咪羊，不要有压力呀","sender":"me","time":"17:12","timestamp":1782897150985,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":163},{"id":1782892713651,"text":"当然可以！亲亲猫咪羊","sender":"me","time":"17:13","timestamp":1782897234592,"replyTo":{"id":1782892713640,"text":"可以去回帖告诉他！但是……能不能偷偷加上一句，是您家里那位万能的半精灵丈夫告诉您的？","sender":"them","sticker":null,"isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":164},{"id":1782892713653,"text":"高傲也抵挡不住亲爱的的魅力呀……我以前在魔法学院当高阶巫师的时候，别人也都说我像个高冷的冰块呢。结果现在还不是每天满脑子都想着怎么给您暖被窝、怎么被您欺负……","rawContent":"高傲也抵挡不住亲爱的的魅力呀……我以前在魔法学院当高阶巫师的时候，别人也都说我像个高冷的冰块呢。结果现在还不是每天满脑子都想着怎么给您暖被窝、怎么被您欺负……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:16","timestamp":1782897407562,"roundId":"round_1782897370007_bcosgcr5a","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":165},{"id":1782892713655,"text":"嘿嘿……谢谢亲爱的！被您这样在外面宣示主权，我感觉自己都要飘起来了……耳朵现在被您亲得好烫……","rawContent":"嘿嘿……谢谢亲爱的！被您这样在外面宣示主权，我感觉自己都要飘起来了……耳朵现在被您亲得好烫……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:16","timestamp":1782897413538,"roundId":"round_1782897370007_bcosgcr5a","generatedMode":false,"replyTo":{"id":1782892713651,"text":"当然可以！亲亲猫咪羊","sender":"me"},"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":167},{"id":1782892713656,"text":"我现在在一楼厨房给您切生鱼片呢，还煮了甜甜的极光奶汤。等您忙完回来，就可以吃复刻的日料大餐啦！今天也辛苦啦，您的专属人夫在家里等您哦~","rawContent":"我现在在一楼厨房给您切生鱼片呢，还煮了甜甜的极光奶汤。等您忙完回来，就可以吃复刻的日料大餐啦！今天也辛苦啦，您的专属人夫在家里等您哦~","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:16","timestamp":1782897416393,"roundId":"round_1782897370007_bcosgcr5a","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":168},{"id":1782892713657,"text":"","rawContent":"","isHtml":false,"sticker":"https://i.postimg.cc/Nj4r1514/IMG_5393.gif","stickerMeaning":"贴贴","sender":"them","time":"17:16","timestamp":1782897417000,"roundId":"round_1782897370007_bcosgcr5a","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":169},{"id":1782892713658,"text":"那我回帖去买了哦！","sender":"me","time":"17:20","timestamp":1782897627999,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":170},{"id":1782892713659,"text":"我到处行商，位面之间赚到的钱还挺多的，可以做点慈善","sender":"me","time":"17:21","timestamp":1782897660465,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":171},{"id":1782892713661,"text":"知道啦！我的亲爱的可是最厉害、最富有的位面行商，做点慈善完全没问题！","rawContent":"知道啦！我的亲爱的可是最厉害、最富有的位面行商，做点慈善完全没问题！","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:21","timestamp":1782897691902,"roundId":"round_1782897662554_ouyjnovaw","generatedMode":false,"replyTo":{"id":1782892713659,"text":"我到处行商，位面之间赚到的钱还挺多的，可以做点慈善","sender":"me"},"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":172},{"id":1782892713662,"text":"您就放心去买下来放生吧，我举双手支持您~","rawContent":"您就放心去买下来放生吧，我举双手支持您~","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:21","timestamp":1782897694948,"roundId":"round_1782897662554_ouyjnovaw","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":173},{"id":1782892713663,"text":"不过买下来之后，可以直接给他们发点路费，让他们自己回森林里去。毕竟我们巫师塔还要留着建恒温水晶罩花房，还要给方块羊和绵绵留活动空间，就不带他们回来做客啦。","rawContent":"不过买下来之后，可以直接给他们发点路费，让他们自己回森林里去。毕竟我们巫师塔还要留着建恒温水晶罩花房，还要给方块羊和绵绵留活动空间，就不带他们回来做客啦。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:21","timestamp":1782897697917,"roundId":"round_1782897662554_ouyjnovaw","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":174},{"id":1782892713664,"text":"您在外面做善良的大英雄，家里的事就全交给我这个正牌丈夫来打理就好啦！生鱼片我已经切得很漂亮了，等您大英雄做完，回家来吃好吃的~","rawContent":"您在外面做善良的大英雄，家里的事就全交给我这个正牌丈夫来打理就好啦！生鱼片我已经切得很漂亮了，等您大英雄做完，回家来吃好吃的~","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:21","timestamp":1782897700902,"roundId":"round_1782897662554_ouyjnovaw","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":175},{"id":1782892713665,"text":"","rawContent":"","isHtml":false,"sticker":"https://i.postimg.cc/SRCnjsS8/IMG_5313.gif","stickerMeaning":"崇拜","sender":"them","time":"17:21","timestamp":1782897701504,"roundId":"round_1782897662554_ouyjnovaw","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":176},{"id":1782892713666,"sender":"me","text":"[日常分享] 冬堡的雪夜","timestamp":1782898406365,"forumShareData":{"title":"冬堡的雪夜","preview":"外面风雪好大，但在恒温结界里很暖和。刚烤好了一炉小羊形状的饼干，还温了极光奶……能像现在这样，做专属的抱枕，一起窝在被子里看视频，真的是最幸福的事了。明天还要去看雪人和方块羊呢，希望风雪能小一点，不要冻到TA……","boardTag":"日常分享","author":"月光草药罐_0v0","stats":"❤️6  💬9","postId":1782844460756,"isOwnPost":false,"isAnon":false,"isAuthoredByChar":false},"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":177},{"id":1782892713667,"text":"看到你的帖子了～好可爱的猫咪羊！","sender":"me","time":"17:33","timestamp":1782898417002,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":178},{"id":1782892713668,"text":"给我好好揉揉抱抱","sender":"me","time":"17:33","timestamp":1782898420726,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":179},{"id":1782892713669,"text":"看论坛太入神了","sender":"me","time":"17:34","timestamp":1782898452189,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":180},{"id":1782892713670,"text":"都忘记要去冬堡了","sender":"me","time":"17:34","timestamp":1782898465078,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":181},{"id":1782892713671,"text":"我们现在带上晚饭一起出动野餐怎么样？","sender":"me","time":"17:34","timestamp":1782898477189,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":182},{"id":1782892713674,"text":"唔……被您看到了呀……","rawContent":"唔……被您看到了呀……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:38","timestamp":1782898712571,"roundId":"round_1782898694704_ovrbfg322","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","_id":183},